      <ul>
        <li>Validated product-market fit through on-ground surveys, interviews with freelancers, remittance centers, and receivers—uncovered that people hold foreign currency in physical cash to hedge inflation, and that 65%+ of Pakistan's crypto trades are USDT with no legal fiat off-ramp. Findings shaped ZAR's core product direction.</li>
